      "content": "hey i need some help with some math/probability stuff. i've been noticing some crazy things lately and i want to see if it's actually statistically significant or just me being weird. \n\nso like, for the last 3 days, every time i think about a specific person i haven't spoken to in years, i see their name on a billboard, or a license plate, or even just a random email subject line. and then today, i was thinking about a specific number (444) and it appeared on the digital clock, my gas pump, and then a receipt. \n\ncould you help me calculate the odds of these kinds of things happening back-to-back like that? i feel like there's a pattern here but i need the numbers to understand it.",
